{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-18 19:37:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS MEDTRONIC PLC INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF NOVEMBER 7, 2022 - MDT', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - OCTOBER 18, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN MEDTRONIC PLC ("MEDTRONIC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: MDT) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF MEDTRONIC INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE DISTRICT OF MINNESOTA.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC LEVERAGES DATA SCIENCE TO LAUNCH FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND PERSONALIZED INSIGHTS PROGRAM FOR PEOPLE LIVING WITH DIABETES', 'text': "DUBLIN , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC, THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY, IS INTRODUCING A NEW PROGRAM CALLED MY INSIGHTS EXCLUSIVELY MADE FOR INDIVIDUALS USING THE MINIMED™ 770G SYSTEM. USING AN INDIVIDUAL'S DATA, MY INSIGHTS RELIES ON THE POWER OF DATA SCIENCE TO PROVIDE PERSONALIZED TIPS, TRENDS, AND REMINDERS THAT CUSTOMERS CAN USE TO HELP WITH THEIR DIABETES MANAGEMENT GOALS."}